---

<section id="about" class="py-20 lg:py-28 border-t border-[var(--color-border-hairline)]">
  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8 lg:gap-12 items-start">
    <!-- Left: Label & Anchor Indicator -->
    <div class="lg:col-span-4 flex flex-col gap-2">
      <span class="text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] font-semibold tracking-[0.2em] uppercase text-[var(--color-text-tertiary)]">
        About Shinerva
      </span>
    </div>

    <!-- Right: Editorial Narrative -->
    <div class="lg:col-span-8 flex flex-col gap-8 max-w-3xl">
      <h2 class="text-[28px] sm:text-[36px] md:text-[42px] font-medium leading-[1.18] tracking-[-0.028em] text-[var(--color-text-primary)] text-balance">
        We build technology businesses around ideas worth pursuing.
      </h2>

      <p class="text-[17px] sm:text-[19px] leading-[1.65] text-[var(--color-text-secondary)] font-normal tracking-[-0.01em]">
        Shinerva develops and grows digital products across AI, software, data, and emerging technology. Each business operates independently while sharing a common ambition: building useful technology with lasting value.
      </p>

      <div class="pt-2">
        <a
          href="#contact"
          class="group inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-[14px] font-medium text-[var(--color-text-primary)] hover:opacity-80 transition-opacity"
        >
          <span>Connect with our team</span>
          <svg
            class="w-4 h-4 transition-transform duration-200 group-hover:translate-x-1"
            viewBox="0 0 16 16"
            fill="none"
            stroke="currentColor"
            stroke-width="1.75"
            stroke-linecap="round"
            stroke-linejoin="round"
            aria-hidden="true"
          >
            <path d="M3.333 8h9.334" />
            <path d="M8.667 4l4 4-4 4" />
          </svg>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
